---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SOCIAL_LINKS } from '../consts';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Thisara - cloud support engineer, Azure and FinOps.">
  <article class="narrow">
    <header class="post-head">
      <h1>About me</h1>
      <p class="lead">I'm Thisara, a cloud support engineer from Sri Lanka working with Microsoft Azure.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I write here about the things I learn on the job and on my own: running workloads on Azure,
        keeping cloud bills under control, and free tools that help students and junior engineers get started.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm also active in the Sri Lankan cloud and FinOps community as a speaker and content creator.
        If something here helps you, or you spot a mistake, I'd love to hear from you.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-card">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px">Certifications</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Microsoft Certified: Azure Administrator Associate (AZ-104)</li>
        <li>FinOps Certified</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="about-card">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px">Find me</h2>
      <ul>
        {SOCIAL_LINKS.map((s) => <li><a href={s.href} rel="me noopener">{s.label}</a></li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
